                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Any reason you comment out above line and use aspeed-ast2600-evb.dtb? Other platforms such as Catalina, harma uses aspeed/${KMACHINE}-bmc-facebook-${MACHINE}.dtb only."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/conf/machine/santabarbara.conf",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Fred Chen",
                        "email": "Fred.Chen@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "fredchenquanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Since santabarbara device tree isn\u2019t available in the Linux kernel yet, we\u2019re temporarily using an existing DTS to avoid build errors. Once it\u2019s merged, we\u2019ll update it."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/conf/machine/santabarbara.conf",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@Fred.Chen@quantatw.com Can you please share the lore link for the upstream Linux kernel patch for device tree ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/conf/machine/santabarbara.conf",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Fred Chen",
                        "email": "Fred.Chen@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "fredchenquanta"
                    },
                    "message": "We\u2019re still waiting for one last board to arrive, which is expected next Monday. Once we complete verification, I\u2019ll push the DTS to the Linux kernel and share the lore link."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/conf/machine/santabarbara.conf",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Please add a comment here as to why it is temporarily set to dtb.  It is fine to merge this once the comment is added and then we'll update later."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/conf/machine/santabarbara.conf",
                    "line": 5,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Fred Chen",
